ind":"announcement","title":"v0.2.7: Science Overhaul","summary":"Science OverhaulThis is a small update with a focus on Science Balancing.Each item now has its own science value, and no longer uses the sale price. The more crafting steps go into an item, the higher the science efficiency: an Iron Bar yields science 4 times as fast as a raw item, and an Engine 16 times as fast.The science car now also takes raw items, for 1 science point each.Other notable changesCheaper recipes: Iron Plate and Screw now cost 120 credits each (was 200), Scrap Ingot now costs 4","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T09:43:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028220","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:20:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4461020-1846651706696629","game_id":"steam-4461020","kind":"announcement","title":"v0.2.5: Ground Scans","summary":"This update introduces the new Ground Scans minigame.After you repaired the scan drone in the Refinery stage, activate it to scan the ground. You have a short period of time to boost the ratios of ores.We heard your feedback about ore ratios! While we did some balancing, you can also use this new mechanic to influence the ratio of ores.Other notable changes You can now drag items on the ground, the same as cargo items.The Engine recipe is now cheaper, costing 1 bearing and 1 iron plate.The furna","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:11:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696629","verified_at":"2026-10-21T05:36:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4461020-1846651706694095","game_id":"steam-4461020","kind":"announcement","title":"Factory on a Train: New Demo for NextFest","summary":"A whole new demoOver the 